WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:35.577
At the beginning of Chapter 13,

2
00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:37.245
Arjuna wishes to gain clarity

3
00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:40.915
on six important principles.

4
00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:43.668
Prakriti, which is material nature.

5
00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:46.838
Purusha, which means the enjoyer.

6
00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:49.841
Kshetra, meaning the field of activity.

7
00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:52.927
Kshetrajna, who is the knower of the field.

8
00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:56.264
Jnana, meaning the process of
gaining knowledge,

9
00:00:56.264 --> 00:01:00.643
and jneya, which means the
object of knowledge.

10
00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:04.147
These subjects are the core foundations
of spiritual understanding.

11
00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:05.690
They reveal

12
00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:09.694
how the soul connects with material nature,

13
00:01:09.694 --> 00:01:11.154
and how spiritual knowledge

14
00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:13.615
leads to liberation.

15
00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:20.538
Arjuna expresses to Lord Krishna his wish

16
00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:23.666
to understand those deep principles

17
00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:25.168
that shape the understanding of body, soul,

18
00:01:25.168 --> 00:01:28.588
and the supreme truth.

19
00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:31.633
First he asks about prakriti,

20
00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:35.345
which means material nature.

21
00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:37.347
Then about purusha,

22
00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:40.892
the conscious being and the enjoyer.

23
00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:43.311
Kshetra is the field of activity

24
00:01:43.311 --> 00:01:46.648
commonly referred to as the body.

25
00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:50.026
Kshetrajna is the one who knows

26
00:01:50.026 --> 00:01:52.112
and experiences that field.

27
00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:55.115
This encompasses both the individual soul
and the Supreme Soul,

28
00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.867
both of whom dwell within the body.

29
00:01:57.867 --> 00:01:59.536
Jnana is the process

30
00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:01.913
through which right understanding is gained,

31
00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:04.999
and this is the supreme object
of that understanding,

32
00:02:04.999 --> 00:02:08.253
the experience of the Supreme Soul.

33
00:02:08.253 --> 00:02:12.382
Through these questions, Arjuna
reveals his curiosity to understand,

34
00:02:12.382 --> 00:02:16.219
of soul, body, and the Supreme, the relationship.

35
00:02:16.219 --> 00:02:19.139
This discussion reveals that a right

36
00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:22.308
understanding of these principles
opens the door to liberation.

37
00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:25.228
In the first part of the Gita,
Lord Krishna explained

38
00:02:25.228 --> 00:02:27.730
how practice done through karma and jnana

39
00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:30.900
leads toward devotion.

40
00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:33.611
In the middle chapters, the supremacy
of devotion

41
00:02:33.611 --> 00:02:35.155
was made clear.

42
00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:39.159
Now, in the final six chapters, He explains,

43
00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:42.078
when spiritual knowledge meets devotion,

44
00:02:42.078 --> 00:02:43.663
it carries the seeker to pure

45
00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:47.041
devotion and liberation.

46
00:02:51.129 --> 00:02:54.340
Have you ever felt

47
00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:58.595
that you were satisfied with only
a surface-level understanding?

48
00:02:58.595 --> 00:03:01.431
About your relationships, your work,

49
00:03:01.431 --> 00:03:04.601
or yourself?

50
00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:09.522
Perhaps you know what is happening,

51
00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:11.816
but have you paused

52
00:03:11.816 --> 00:03:14.611
to think about

53
00:03:14.611 --> 00:03:18.072
why it is happening?

54
00:03:18.072 --> 00:03:20.658
Arjuna did not do this.

55
00:03:20.658 --> 00:03:24.495
Even after hearing deep truths

56
00:03:24.495 --> 00:03:29.459
from Me in previous chapters, he did not say,

57
00:03:29.459 --> 00:03:32.587
I now know everything.

58
00:03:32.587 --> 00:03:34.631
He asked again.

59
00:03:34.631 --> 00:03:38.843
With complete sincerity, without ego.

60
00:03:38.843 --> 00:03:42.597
Not to argue, not to prove anything,

61
00:03:42.597 --> 00:03:46.267
but simply because he

62
00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:48.686
wanted clarity.

63
00:03:48.686 --> 00:03:51.397
This is the spirit of true learning,

64
00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:55.818
where you give up the pretence of knowing

65
00:03:55.818 --> 00:04:00.490
and ask with a genuine heart,

66
00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:02.408
is it not?

67
00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:06.663
Perhaps you too have heard spiritual

68
00:04:06.663 --> 00:04:12.710
things before, or read scriptures,

69
00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:17.215
but have you paused and asked yourself,

70
00:04:17.215 --> 00:04:19.133
what is the real

71
00:04:19.133 --> 00:04:22.470
purpose of my life?

72
00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:27.725
Am I simply drifting through a daily routine?

73
00:04:27.725 --> 00:04:31.104
Do not be afraid to ask,

74
00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:33.106
but ask.

75
00:04:33.106 --> 00:04:35.275
Like Arjuna,

76
00:04:35.275 --> 00:04:39.654
with humility and deep curiosity.

77
00:04:39.654 --> 00:04:41.072
This approach

78
00:04:41.072 --> 00:04:44.993
does not only grow your knowledge.

79
00:04:44.993 --> 00:04:48.997
It transforms you from within.

80
00:04:48.997 --> 00:04:52.083
Do not be afraid to ask,

81
00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:54.585
but if you must ask,

82
00:04:54.585 --> 00:04:57.297
then ask like Arjuna.

83
00:04:57.297 --> 00:05:01.509
With humility, and with a deep

84
00:05:01.509 --> 00:05:03.344
desire to understand.

85
00:05:03.344 --> 00:05:04.554
This mindset

86
00:05:04.554 --> 00:05:08.266
can not only grow your knowledge,

87
00:05:08.266 --> 00:05:11.853
but can also bring a positive

88
00:05:11.853 --> 00:05:14.022
change within you.

89
00:05:18.401 --> 00:05:21.779
Think and tell me, have you seen this?

90
00:05:21.779 --> 00:05:24.407
In many families, scriptures

91
00:05:24.407 --> 00:05:27.493
remain on shelves.

92
00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:29.203
Prayers are said,

93
00:05:29.203 --> 00:05:31.456
and festivals are celebrated too,

94
00:05:31.456 --> 00:05:32.248
but their

95
00:05:32.248 --> 00:05:36.044
meaning is rarely ever reflected upon.

96
00:05:36.044 --> 00:05:40.506
Arjuna was not satisfied after hearing once.

97
00:05:40.506 --> 00:05:43.217
He asked again, sincerely,

98
00:05:43.217 --> 00:05:45.428
without ego.

99
00:05:45.428 --> 00:05:48.765
He wanted clarity.

100
00:05:48.765 --> 00:05:52.018
Bring this same spirit into your home.

101
00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:54.812
Instead of merely following tradition,

102
00:05:54.812 --> 00:06:00.026
understand what its real meaning is.

103
00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:03.279
When you read or hear something
from scripture,

104
00:06:03.279 --> 00:06:06.949
let the family sit together and discuss it.

105
00:06:06.949 --> 00:06:08.242
Ask,

106
00:06:08.242 --> 00:06:10.745
what does this have to do with us?

107
00:06:10.745 --> 00:06:14.332
When conversations like this happen in a family,

108
00:06:14.332 --> 00:06:17.627
relationships deepen.

109
00:06:17.627 --> 00:06:19.712
Children also learn

110
00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:22.715
that just following rules is not enough,

111
00:06:22.715 --> 00:06:25.927
understanding matters too.

112
00:06:25.927 --> 00:06:29.680
This builds a firm foundation for faith.

113
00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:32.016
When asking questions and seeking

114
00:06:32.016 --> 00:06:35.812
answers becomes a habit of the household,

115
00:06:35.812 --> 00:06:39.107
then that home becomes not merely
a place of tradition,

116
00:06:39.107 --> 00:06:42.026
but a place of living faith

117
00:06:42.026 --> 00:06:45.238
and understanding.

118
00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:49.367
In this way, the foundation of faith becomes real,

119
00:06:49.367 --> 00:06:51.828
and it does not rest only on

120
00:06:51.828 --> 00:06:54.622
inherited traditions.

121
00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.629
Your growth at the workplace

122
00:07:01.629 --> 00:07:05.133
does not depend only on your skill,

123
00:07:05.133 --> 00:07:06.676
but also on two

124
00:07:06.676 --> 00:07:10.054
inner qualities.

125
00:07:10.054 --> 00:07:13.433
The desire to learn, and humility.

126
00:07:13.433 --> 00:07:17.478
Without being humble, you will not ask.

127
00:07:17.478 --> 00:07:19.772
And if you do not ask,

128
00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:22.650
you will never learn.

129
00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:27.280
But being humble alone is not enough.

130
00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:31.492
Some people are humble and respectful,

131
00:07:31.492 --> 00:07:34.287
but within them the inner fire

132
00:07:34.287 --> 00:07:37.290
of curiosity is absent.

133
00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.625
The desire to move forward, to explore,

134
00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:45.381
and to reach their full potential.

135
00:07:45.381 --> 00:07:49.552
So how do you develop both qualities?

136
00:07:49.552 --> 00:07:52.889
Let me tell you.

137
00:07:52.889 --> 00:07:55.433
Humility comes

138
00:07:55.433 --> 00:07:58.311
when you acknowledge

139
00:07:58.311 --> 00:08:02.064
that I do not know everything.

140
00:08:02.064 --> 00:08:05.735
I need others,

141
00:08:05.735 --> 00:08:10.156
I need to learn more.

142
00:08:10.156 --> 00:08:14.368
And the eagerness to learn comes

143
00:08:14.368 --> 00:08:17.622
when you feel,

144
00:08:17.622 --> 00:08:22.543
I have not yet reached my best.

145
00:08:22.543 --> 00:08:26.756
I am capable of more.

146
00:08:26.756 --> 00:08:30.551
I have not yet reached

147
00:08:30.551 --> 00:08:34.430
where I truly want to go.

148
00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:36.432
Look at Arjuna.

149
00:08:36.432 --> 00:08:38.726
He was a skilled

150
00:08:38.726 --> 00:08:41.812
and respected warrior,

151
00:08:41.812 --> 00:08:43.481
but he still asked

152
00:08:43.481 --> 00:08:46.734
questions with genuine curiosity.

153
00:08:46.734 --> 00:08:51.072
This mindset is what builds your career.

154
00:08:51.072 --> 00:08:53.366
When you combine humility

155
00:08:53.366 --> 00:08:57.036
and eagerness to learn,

156
00:08:57.036 --> 00:09:00.706
you do not just rise.

157
00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:05.795
You rise in a meaningful and lasting way.

158
00:09:05.795 --> 00:09:06.879
Stay humble

159
00:09:06.879 --> 00:09:09.590
and curious,

160
00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:13.803
and the paths toward Me will keep opening.
